      "title": {
        "ja": "Service Bus Premium のパーティション分割名前空間で Geo-Replication が GA",
        "subtitleJa": "スループット拡張と、セカンダリ リージョンへのメッセージ複製を併用できます",
        "en": "Generally Available: Geo-Replication on partitioned namespaces for Azure Service Bus Premium"
      },
      "meta": {
        "publishedJst": "2026-11-03",
        "availability": [{ "rawRing": "General Availability", "year": 2026, "month": "November" }],
        "status": "Launched",
        "products": ["Service Bus"],
        "categories": ["integration"],
        "importance": "notable"
      },
      "audience": {
        "who": { "text": "**Service Bus Premium のパーティション分割名前空間**を使う、または検討している方", "origin": "mrc", "assertion": "inference", "verification": "source-only" },
        "change": { "text": "高スループットと、リージョン障害への備えを 1 つの名前空間で両立できる", "origin": "mrc", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "source-only" },
        "changeNature": "benefit"
      },
      "action": {
        "required": "optional",
        "summary": { "text": "リージョン障害対策が必要なら検討", "origin": "editorial", "assertion": "recommendation", "verification": "unverified" }
      },
      "panels": [
        {
          "id": "how-it-works", "heading": "仕組み", "availability": "present", "priority": "core",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "メタデータとデータをプライマリからセカンダリ リージョンへ継続的にレプリケート",
              "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified",
              "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/azure/service-bus-messaging/service-bus-geo-replication", "locator": "冒頭", "retrievedAt": "2026-11-05T00:30:00Z" }]
            },
            {
              "text": "セカンダリはいつでもプライマリに昇格でき、ホスト名は新プライマリを指す",
              "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified",
              "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/azure/service-bus-messaging/service-bus-geo-replication", "locator": "概要", "retrievedAt": "2026-11-05T00:30:00Z" }]
            },
            {
              "text": "パーティション分割は、キューとトピックを複数ブローカーに分散する",
              "origin": "mrc", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "source-only"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "how-to-start", "heading": "始め方", "availability": "present", "priority": "core",
          "items": [
            { "text": "既存のパーティション分割 Premium 名前空間で Geo-Replication を有効化できる", "origin": "mrc", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "source-only" },
            {
              "text": "新規作成時は、パーティション数を指定して作成し、セカンダリ リージョンを追加",
              "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified",
              "evidence": [
                { "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/azure/service-bus-messaging/enable-partitions-premium", "locator": "Azure Portal の使用", "retrievedAt": "2026-11-05T00:30:00Z" },
                { "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/azure/service-bus-messaging/service-bus-geo-replication", "locator": "セットアップ", "retrievedAt": "2026-11-05T00:30:00Z" }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "prerequisites-limits", "heading": "前提・制限", "availability": "present", "priority": "detail",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Premium 層が対象。セカンダリ リージョンは 1 つのみ、大きなメッセージは未対応",
              "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified",
              "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/azure/service-bus-messaging/service-bus-geo-replication", "locator": "注・重要", "retrievedAt": "2026-11-05T00:30:00Z" }]
            },
            {
              "text": "Geo-Disaster Recovery とは併用不可。パーティション数は作成後に変更不可",
              "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified",
              "evidence": [
                { "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/azure/service-bus-messaging/service-bus-geo-replication", "locator": "重要", "retrievedAt": "2026-11-05T00:30:00Z" },
                { "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/azure/service-bus-messaging/enable-partitions-premium", "locator": "注", "retrievedAt": "2026-11-05T00:30:00Z" }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "related-features", "heading": "似た機能との違い", "availability": "present", "priority": "detail",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Geo-Replication はデータも複製、Geo-Disaster Recovery はメタデータのみ複製",
              "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified",
              "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/azure/service-bus-messaging/service-bus-geo-replication", "locator": "Geo-Replication と Geo-Disaster Recovery", "retrievedAt": "2026-11-05T00:30:00Z" }]
            },
            {
              "text": "ほとんどのディザスター リカバリー シナリオで Geo-Replication を推奨",
              "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified",
              "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/azure/service-bus-messaging/service-bus-geo-replication", "locator": "Geo-Replication と Geo-Disaster Recovery", "retrievedAt": "2026-11-05T00:30:00Z" }]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "use-case", "heading": "使いどころ・注意", "availability": "present", "priority": "detail",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "計画メンテナンス時の昇格や、別リージョンへの移行にも使える",
              "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified",
              "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/azure/service-bus-messaging/service-bus-geo-replication", "locator": "Azure リージョンの移行", "retrievedAt": "2026-11-05T00:30:00Z" }]
            },
            {
              "text": "強制昇格ではデータの損失や重複が起こりうる",
              "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified",
              "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/azure/service-bus-messaging/service-bus-geo-replication", "locator": "レプリケーション モード", "retrievedAt": "2026-11-05T00:30:00Z" }]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
